    prompt: 'You\'re a product analyst at Zynga. The team wants to see how each player\'s level activity compares to everyone else\'s, so they can target the least-engaged players. For each player, return their user_id, their total number of level attempts, and where that activity sits as a percentile across all players (0 = least active, 1 = most active), rounded to 2 decimals — name this column pct_rank. List the players ordered by user_id.',
