    prompt: 'Finance at Shopify wants to see how each customer\'s spending builds up over time — after every order, what has that customer spent in total so far? Return one row per order with order_id, user_id, created_at, subtotal, and the customer\'s cumulative spend through that order as running_total. Order by user_id, then created_at.',
