    hints: ['What does one row in your result represent? Your output needs 13 rows with columns: user_id, username, last_interaction_date, days_since_last.', 'A CTE (WITH clause) lets you name an intermediate result and reuse it. Identify which sub-result you need before the final SELECT.'],
