    prompt: 'Chime\'s risk team needs a prioritized list of users for review based on their account status, risk tier, and transaction behavior. The query should return user_id, email, risk score (a composite of account balance, risk tier, and transaction flags), and total flagged transactions. Filter results to include only users with a risk score above 70, ordered by the highest score first. ',
