    prompt: 'The merchant analytics team uses a weekly category revenue report to guide inventory decisions. The report\'s electronics category total appears lower than expected, indicating a potential issue with the revenue calculation. Ensure the query correctly sums the revenue for electronics category products, considering all relevant order and product details. ',
