      { text: 'Examine how to aggregate transaction data for each seller while ensuring all sellers are accounted for, including those with no completed transactions.', starterCode: 'SELECT s.seller_id, s.name,\n  COALESCE(ROUND(SUM(t.sale_price), 2), 0) AS total_gmv\nFROM sellers s\n-- your window function here\nGROUP BY s.seller_id, s.name' }
